text.section:
The Program shall:

Identify food access projects that include grocery stores, small food retailers, and innovative food retail projects;


Provide grants for the purposes described in subsection A;


Require that grant recipients (i) accept expenditures of benefits provided under the supplemental nutrition assistance program in accordance with the federal Food Stamp Act (7 U.S.C. § 2011 et seq.) and (ii) participate in a program that matches or supplements the benefits identified in clause (i), such as Virginia Fresh Match;


Provide technical assistance; and


Bring together community partners to sustain the Program.
